### Health check

GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register (if needed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "village": "Village X",
  "district": "Sirsa",
  "state": "Haryana",
  "languagePreference": "en",
  "phone": "9999999999",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login (copy token from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get profile (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update profile (protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "village": "Village Y",
  "district": "Sirsa",
  "state": "Haryana",
  "phone": "8888888888"
}

### Post water report (protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/water
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "phValue": 7.0,
  "turbidity": 10,
  "bacterialevel": 120,
  "village": "Kalanwali",
  "waterSource": "Well",
  "nitrate_mg_per_l": 3
}

### Get water reports (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/water
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trigger / get latest prediction (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get homepage prediction data (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions/homepage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Doctor: predictions by district (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctor/predictions/district?district=Sirsa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Doctor: graph data (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctor/predictions/graph?district=Sirsa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
